      "short_code": "SEMI01",
      "kind": "math_boundary",
      "title": "非縮退半導体のキャリア濃度（ボルツマン近似）",
      "summary": "伝導帯・価電子帯の有効状態密度とフェルミ・ディラック分布の非縮退極限による電子・正孔濃度の表現。",
      "canonical_latex": "n = N_c \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{E_c - E_F}{k_B T}\\right),\\quad p = N_v \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{E_F - E_v}{k_B T}\\right)\\quad (E_c - E_F \\gg k_B T,\\; E_F - E_v \\gg k_B T)",
      "aliases_latex": [
        "n=N_c e^{-(E_c-E_F)/k_BT},\\; p=N_v e^{-(E_F-E_v)/k_BT}"
      ],
      "keywords": [
